   "source": [
    "# Stage 1: Disease Recognition Foundation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objectif**: Fine-tune Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct sur la reconnaissance de maladies des cultures\n",
    "\n",
    "## Datasets\n",
    "- PlantVillage VQA: 20,638 échantillons (3 crops, 10 diseases)\n",
    "- CDDM Disease Diagnosis: 3,963 échantillons VQA\n",
    "- CDDM Disease Knowledge: 20 échantillons (connaissances expertes)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Total**: 24,621 échantillons\n",
    "\n",
    "## Métriques Target\n",
    "- Disease classification accuracy: >90%\n",
    "- Crop identification accuracy: >95%\n",
    "\n",
    "## Temps Estimé\n",
    "6-8 heures sur V100 16GB"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Installation et Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
